@startuml SQLGenie_MCP_Architecture
title SQLGenie MCP - Simple Architecture

actor User
component "Claude Desktop" as Claude
component "MCP Server" as Server
database "DBs" as DB

User --> Claude : "Show me customers"
Claude --> Server : MCP call
Server --> DB : SQL query
DB --> Server : results
Server --> Claude : data
Claude --> User : answer

note right of Server : 4 MCP Tools:\n- list_databases\n- get_schema\n- execute_query\n- analyze_results

@enduml